{
  "why": "The SVG animated-attribute generator's hand facts (gen_svg): ATTR_OVERRIDE = members whose content attribute name is not mechanically derivable from the member name (`in1` is the `in` attribute); HREF_MEMBERS = the SVG URL reference (plain `href`, legacy `xlink:href` fallback); ANIMATED = the SVGAnimated* types this generator implements (anything else stays a shell rather than being reflected wrongly); ENUM_TABLE = the constant-name prefix an SVGAnimatedEnumeration member's keywords are read from (declared once per interface family in the IDL); KEYWORD_FIX = keyword spellings that are not the constant suffix lowercased. VALUE_MEMBERS = the SVG value types' own members that `kits::svg_value` bodies (core/dom/svg_values.rs): an entry goes in when the member's answer is computable from the owning element's content attribute (or, for a detached value, from its own slot), and comes out when a real implementation takes the member. CREATE_VALUE = the SVGSVGElement factory methods, each naming the DETACHED value interface it mints.",
